# DEVOPS PRACTICAL EXAM – MASTER CHEAT SHEET

## 1. DOCKER & DOCKER COMPOSE

### A. Check Docker installation

```cmd
docker --version
docker compose version
docker info
```

### B. Important Docker commands

```cmd
docker images
docker ps
docker ps -a
docker pull nginx
docker run -d -p 8080:80 --name mycontainer nginx
docker stop mycontainer
docker start mycontainer
docker restart mycontainer
docker rm -f mycontainer
docker logs mycontainer
docker exec -it mycontainer sh
```

### C. Create docker-compose.yml

```yaml
services:
  frontend:
    image: nginx
    ports:
      - "8080:80"

  backend:
    image: nginx
    ports:
      - "8081:80"

  database:
    image: mysql:8
    environment:
      MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD: root123
```

Save as `docker-compose.yml`.

### D. Execute Compose commands

```cmd
docker compose up -d
docker compose ps
docker compose logs
docker compose logs -f
docker compose stop
docker compose start
docker compose restart
docker compose down
docker compose up --build -d
docker compose stop backend
```

### E. Important differences

| Command | Purpose |
|---|---|
| up -d | Create and start services |
| stop | Stop containers |
| start | Start existing containers |
| down | Remove containers and default network |
| restart | Restart services |
| logs | Display logs |
| ps | List services |

